    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2LsmML8L7aw9coNUrrWP8iz)_\n\n## Merge order\n\n- Based on `main` after #508; independent of #509 (touches other files). Merging it makes the `tangle` check green on #509 after that PR is updated with `main`.\n- Branch is `claude/project-thread-vp77bk-tangle`: the cloud proxy cannot rename a branch, so it needs the number prefix from Sia.\n\n## What changed\n\n- `sp-litnotes-refs.el` and `sp-litnotes-titles.el` did not match what their docs tangle to (drift from #508).\n- They are now the tangled output of `sp-litnotes-refs.org` and `sp-litnotes-titles.org`; no doc and no behaviour changed.\n- `tools/check-tangle.sh` now prints \"All tangled modules match their docs.\"\n\n## Manual testing\n\n- [ ] CI `tangle` check is green\n- [ ] `M-x sp-litnotes-titles-dryrun` and `M-x sp-litnotes-refs-dryrun` still open their reports\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiA9pvREDF2uyWN7wMC)_",
